    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131-a13">

                <pb facs="0251" n="905" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg905"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7 in 2 in No.
                    219.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Justice Minguin to Justice Bourboi.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Precinct No</hi>. 5, <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hidalgo County,
                                Texas</hi>.</placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1875-03-06T23:59:59-05:50"
                            notBefore="1875-03-04T00:00:00-05:50"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>To-day, about 8 o’clock, I received news that in the rancho Saint Miguel, Los
                    Cuevas, an armed force are there with the purpose of crossing on this side of
                    the Bravo. It is not known for what purpose or what object, nor the number of
                    men, because I have not received the news by writing but verbally, but it is
                    certain and positive.</p>
                <closer><signed>TEODOCIA MINGUIN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">To Justice of the
                            Peace, Precinct No</hi>. 4.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
